			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"text": "CRITICAL: Plan IP addresses to NEVER overlap!  AWS: 10.x.x.x  |  Azure: 172.16.x.x  |  GCP: 192.168.x.x  |  On-prem: 10.200.x.x\nIf two networks have the same IP range, they CANNOT connect. Plan this BEFORE building anything!",
