		{
			"id": "zBaW5Cmo",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 2365,
			"y": 990,
			"width": 533.0703125,
			"height": 220,
			"strokeColor": "#94A3B8",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"text": "HOW IT WORKS:\n① Your data center connects to a colocation facility (physical fiber cable)\n② At the colo, a cross-connect (physical cable) links you to the AWS DX port\n③ DX port provides 1, 10, or 100 Gbps dedicated bandwidth\n④ You create Virtual Interfaces: Private VIF (→VPC) or Transit VIF (→TGW→all VPCs)\n⑤ Traffic flows on dedicated fiber — NEVER touches the public internet!\n\nWHEN TO USE DX:\n• Need consistent, predictable latency (finance, real-time apps)\n• High bandwidth (1-100 Gbps) — VPN maxes at 1.25 Gbps\n• Production workloads with large data transfers\n• Compliance requirements (data must not traverse internet)\n\nSPECS:  Speed: 1/10/100 Gbps (dedicated) or 50M-10G (hosted)\n        Latency: consistent & predictable  |  Setup: 2-4 weeks\n        Cost: ~$0.30/hr (1G port) + $0.02/GB  |  MACsec encryption optional",
			"fontSize": 11,
			"fontFamily": 3,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "HOW IT WORKS:\n① Your data center connects to a colocation facility (physical fiber cable)\n② At the colo, a cross-connect (physical cable) links you to the AWS DX port\n③ DX port provides 1, 10, or 100 Gbps dedicated bandwidth\n④ You create Virtual Interfaces: Private VIF (→VPC) or Transit VIF (→TGW→all VPCs)\n⑤ Traffic flows on dedicated fiber — NEVER touches the public internet!\n\nWHEN TO USE DX:\n• Need consistent, predictable latency (finance, real-time apps)\n• High bandwidth (1-100 Gbps) — VPN maxes at 1.25 Gbps\n• Production workloads with large data transfers\n• Compliance requirements (data must not traverse internet)\n\nSPECS:  Speed: 1/10/100 Gbps (dedicated) or 50M-10G (hosted)\n        Latency: consistent & predictable  |  Setup: 2-4 weeks\n        Cost: ~$0.30/hr (1G port) + $0.02/GB  |  MACsec encryption optional",
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"seed": 41156,
